
Constable
=========

This directory contains the Medusa authorization server. The maintained
overview, build instructions, architecture, policy-language documentation, and
test commands are in ../README.md and ../docs/.

Quick build:

	make -C ../libmcompiler
	make
	make test

Command-line help:

	./constable --help

The Linux-2.x force-code loader and incomplete C preprocessor are intentionally
retired. See ../docs/retired-components.md.
